  Slug: custodian-of-groves-and-gardens
  DisplayName: Custodian of Groves and Gardens
  IconPath: icons/environment/wilderness/tree-ash.webp
  Description: 'Custodians of groves and gardens frequent tended greenery and farmlands
    cared for by loving stewards, and other places of reflection and restoration
    where green things grow. Some of these apparitions linger in the mortal realms
    not because they have lost their way, but because they believe they have already
    found Elysium. Others are the cultivated spiritual essence of the location itself.
    Custodians of groves and gardens are peaceful, quiet, and averse to conflict.
    Apparition Skills Farming Lore, Herbalism Lore Apparition Spells Cantrip @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Tangle
    Vine] 1st @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Protector Tree] 2nd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gentle
    Breeze] 3rd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Safe Passage] 4th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Peaceful
    Bubble] 5th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truespeech] 6th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Field
    of Life] 7th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Lifewood Cage] 8th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Moment
    of Renewal] 9th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Nature''s Enmity] Vessel
    Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Garden of Healing] Avatar Peaceful
    Reaches Speed 60 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain
    Melee 1 garden''s cradle (agile, nonlethal, reach 10 feet, trip), Damage @Damage[(6d6+6)[bludgeoning]]
    plus Grab Ranged 1 impose peace (nonlethal, range 120 feet), Damage @Damage[(6d6+6)[mental]]'
